		(descr "Capacitor SMD 1210 (3225 Metric), square (rectangular) end terminal, IPC-7351 nominal, (Body size source: IPC-SM-782 page 76, https://www.pcb-3d.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/ipc-sm-782a_amendment_1_and_2.pdf)")
