		(property "Description" "CONN HEADER 2x02 2.00mm vertical THT, Harwin Datamate J-Tek M80-5T10442MC with 101-Lok retainers, gold, 3.3A per contact, 800V working, 500 mating cycles, -55 to +125C, 100G shock, low outgassing - BQ79616 COML daisy-chain link; pin 1 = ISO_COMLP and pin 2 = ISO_COMLN share a row for tight differential coupling, pins 3/4 unused. Carries NO ground: the SM91502AL transformer isolates this link, so the cable has no reference and adding one would bridge stacked board grounds"
